---
---

<section id="about" class="section-padding bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <!-- Image / visual side -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
          <div class="w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/20 via-secondary/20 to-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="text-center p-8">
              <div class="w-32 h-32 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-secondary flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="text-5xl text-white font-black">TF</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-dark/40 text-sm italic">Artist photo placeholder</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Decorative accent -->
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 w-48 h-48 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent to-secondary rounded-2xl -z-10 opacity-60"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text side -->
      <div>
        <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full text-sm font-semibold mb-6 tracking-wide uppercase">About the Artist</span>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-dark mb-6 leading-tight">
          Creating art that
          <span class="gradient-text">moves you</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-dark/60 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Theo Falkiner is a contemporary visual artist whose work explores the intersection
          of light, colour, and emotion. Through various mediums including oil painting,
          mixed media, and digital art, Theo creates pieces that invite viewers to pause
          and reflect on the beauty found in everyday moments.
        </p>
        <p class="text-dark/60 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Each piece is crafted with careful attention to detail and a deep commitment to
          artistic expression. Theo's work has been featured in galleries and private
          collections, connecting with audiences who seek art that resonates on an emotional level.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Oil Painting</span>
          <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-secondary/10 text-secondary rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Mixed Media</span>
          <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-accent/10 text-amber-600 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Digital Art</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
